{"asset_key":"timeline/quest_story_13207410","episode":"timeline","category":"quest_story","story_id":"13207410","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:1:1320741001:1":{"text":"準備はいいですか、バヴィル君。これからボクの旅を君に体験させてあげます。","source_cn":"巴维尔，准备好了吗？你将亲自体验我经历过的旅途。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x101B37F4B57C4615","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1320741002:1":{"text":"嘘だ、できっこない……！","source_cn":"骗人……！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x119744439A7398EC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1320741003:1":{"text":"嘘じゃありません。ここにある大小様々な氷晶石と、金属のスプーンがあれば――","source_cn":"我可没骗你。只要把这些大小不一的冰晶石依次摆放，再拿一...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBC0B7777B66CEC33","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1320741004:1":{"text":"さあ、その耳で、よーく「見て」てくださいね――","source_cn":"竖起耳朵，看好了——","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE375869B5A5290A6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1320742001:2":{"text":"す、すごい！メロディーを聴いているだけで、景色が目の前に浮かんでくる！","source_cn":"好、好神奇！只是听着旋律，好像能感受到画面！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC188B7ABCD69053A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1320742002:1":{"text":"白い鳥が羽ばたいて、ガゼルが砂漠を走ってる……他にも、見たことのない動物がたくさん……！","source_cn":"我好像看见了挥动翅膀的白鸟，在沙漠里奔跑的羚羊……看见...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5AAA5B0ABDC1A3A2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1320742003:0":{"text":"飛んだり、跳ねたり、じゃれ合ったり……","source_cn":"它们在飞，在跳，在打闹……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x363FB161883E9F0C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1320742004:1":{"text":"触ってみたい……もっと近くに行ってみたいな。","source_cn":"我想摸摸他们……想到他们身边去。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7A2FE0A8628801C2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1320742005:1":{"text":"きっとできるわ、バヴィル！でも、それにはまず目を治さなきゃ。先生が出したお薬を飲まないと、治るものも治らないわ。","source_cn":"巴维尔……你可以的！但是你要安心治疗，如果连医生给的药...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x39CDFFCB94424DA7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1320742006:1":{"text":"本当に、治るの？この病気は、治るのが難しいって聞いたよ……僕の目はもう……","source_cn":"我真的能恢复吗……我听说，这种病很难恢复……我已经瞎了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9C821673678ED2AC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1320742007:1":